   "line": 5,
   "text": "Push the hum through the bridge. Even samples sit on the true tone. Odd samples are zero. Now add half of one thousand hertz to half of seven thousand. On even samples the halves agree and add up. On odd samples they're opposite, and cancel to zero. Exactly the bridge output.",
