   "line": 6,
   "text": "Why? Each step of the seven thousand dot is a flip, a half turn, then twenty-two and a half degrees back. On even samples the flips pair up into whole turns, so it sits at the hum's mirror spot, the same shadow. On odd samples one flip is left, so the shadow is opposite.",
