   "text": "So the zeros were never silence. They're your tone at half height, plus a second tone, called an image. Upsampling makes one for every tone, at eight thousand hertz minus the tone, mirrored across four thousand. [surprise-oh] A whole voice comes back upside down, from four thousand six hundred to seven thousand seven hundred hertz.",
