   "line": 8,
   "text": "After the zeros, the bridge needs a low-pass filter, gain two below four thousand to undo the halving, and zero above. Averaging a gap's two neighbors slopes too gently. A longer rule steps more steeply. Thirty-one samples keeps the voice, and every image under eight percent.",
